values
  ('agent_tool:run_growth_analysis', 'Trigger a real fresh SEO/AEO/GEO analysis run', 'A real, SSRF-protected crawl of the tenant''s own public pages, real technical-SEO analysis, real competitor discovery, and (when Google Search Console is connected) real query measurement -- producing new opportunities/recommendations, exactly like the dashboard''s manual run. Mirrors app/api/platform/search/run/route.ts''s exact logic (same rate limit, same idempotency-key derivation, same Google-provider resolution) rather than reinventing it. Never touches the live website (that is execute_growth_action''s separate, separately-gated job).', 'website', 'SEO/AEO/GEO analysis trigger', 'run_growth_analysis', 'packages/search-discovery (runSearchAnalysis, resolveGoogleProviderStates) via lib/agent-core/growth-media-tools.ts', 'Engineering', 'google_search_console,ga4', 'agent:mutate:website', 'write', 'tenant', 'free (real crawl + Google API calls where connected)', 'low_mutation', 'interpretGrowthAnalysisOutcome (lib/agent-core/growth-analysis-outcome.ts, unit-tested)', 'REAL_EXPOSED', 'The direct answer to the mission''s "the agent must be able to use the actual engines, not only read dashboard summaries" for SEO/AEO/GEO -- check_growth_status only ever read stored results; this triggers a genuinely new analysis run.', null, now(), 'claude_session_2026-09-02');
